    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000plql](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000plql) Magnitude 5.7 earthquake at 9.0 depth occurred on Jan 22 2025 7km E of Liloan. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 10.131 longitude 125.1803. It impacted 450336 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
